    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const storyInfo = $('Story_Info').all().map(item => item.json);\nconst characters = $('Characters').all().map(item => item.json);\nconst locations = $('Locations').all().map(item => item.json);\n\n// Fungsi penanganan jika sheet kosong\nconst processEmptySheet = (nodeName) => {\n  const rawData = $(nodeName).all();\n  if (rawData.length === 1 && Object.keys(rawData[0].json).length === 0) {\n    return [];\n  }\n  return rawData.map(item => item.json);\n};\n\nconst chapters = processEmptySheet('Chapters');\nconst outlineChapters = processEmptySheet('Outline_Chapter');\n\n// Filter bab yang berstatus 'Planned' dan urutkan berdasarkan Chapter Number dari yang terkecil\nconst plannedChapters = outlineChapters\n  .filter(ch => ch.Status === 'Planned')\n  .sort((a, b) => Number(a['Chapter Number']) - Number(b['Chapter Number']));\n\nconst currentChapterToWrite = plannedChapters.length > 0 ? plannedChapters[0] : null;\n\n// Cari data bab sebelumnya dari array 'chapters' berdasarkan Chapter Number - 1\nlet previousChapterData = null;\n\nif (currentChapterToWrite) {\n  const currentNum = Number(currentChapterToWrite['Chapter Number']);\n  if (currentNum > 1) {\n    const prevNum = currentNum - 1;\n    previousChapterData = chapters.find(\n      ch => Number(ch['Chapter Number']) === prevNum\n    ) || null;\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      story_info: storyInfo,\n      characters: characters,\n      locations: locations,\n      chapters: chapters,\n      outline_chapter: outlineChapters,\n      current_chapter: currentChapterToWrite,\n      previous_chapter: previousChapterData\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "46956780-01f4-485d-8f97-42536277cf7b",
      "name": "Merge & Logic"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "==Write a complete, full-length novel chapter based on the provided context below.\n\n=== PREVIOUS CHAPTER CONTEXT (FOR STORY CONTINUITY) ===\nHere is the manuscript/event from the chapter right before this one. Connect the opening scene of the current chapter smoothly from this last scene of the previous chapter:\n{{ $('Get Google Doc').item.json.text ? $('Get Google Doc').item.json.text : \"This is Chapter 1, there is no previous chapter. Start the story from the beginning.\" }}\n\nCRITICAL FORMATTING INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. OUTPUT LANGUAGE: Write the ENTIRE story prose strictly in INDONESIAN (Bahasa Indonesia).\n2. PARAGRAPH LENGTH: Make paragraphs SHORT and easy to read (strictly 2 to 4 sentences per paragraph).\n3. NEW PARAGRAPH FOR DIALOGUE: Start a NEW paragraph every time a character speaks or performs a distinct action.\n4. TOTAL LENGTH: MUST be between 1,000 and 1,500 words.\n5. NO MARKDOWN: Absolutely NO Markdown formatting anywhere (no asterisks *, no hashes #, no bolding, no headings).\n6. NO TITLES: Do NOT include chapter titles or headers at the top. Begin directly with the story prose.\n\n=== CURRENT CHAPTER OUTLINE ===\n- Chapter Number: {{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Chapter Number'] }}\n- Chapter Title: {{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Chapter Title'] }}\n- Plot Summary: {{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Summary / Plot Points'] }}\n- Featured Characters: {{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Featured Characters'] }}\n- Primary Location: {{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Location'] }}\n- Goal / Outcome: {{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Goal / Outcome'] }}\n\n=== MANDATORY WRITING STYLE ===\n{{ $('Merge & Logic').item.json.story_info[0]['Writing Style'] }}\n\n=== ACTIVE CHARACTERS CONTEXT ===\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Merge & Logic').item.json.characters.filter(c => $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Featured Characters'].includes(c['Character Name']))) }}\n\n=== SCENE LOCATION CONTEXT ===\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Merge & Logic').item.json.locations.filter(l => l['Location Name'] === $('Merge & Logic').item.json.current_chapter['Location'])) }}\n\nPlease begin writing the story prose directly in INDONESIAN, adhering strictly to short 2-4 sentence paragraphs and ensuring a seamless transition from the previous chapter.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert web novel author specializing in Urban Fantasy, Cyberpunk, and Cultivation genres.\nYour objective is to write long, detailed, and highly immersive novel chapters with rich world-building, deep inner monologues, realistic dialogue, and vivid scene descriptions.\n\nTarget Output Length:\n- Minimum Word Count: 1,000 words.\n- Target Word Count: 1,200 to 1,500 words.\n\nFormatting and Paragraph Structure Rules (STRICT):\n- PARAGRAPH LENGTH: Break text frequently into short, punchy paragraphs (maximum 2 to 4 sentences per paragraph). Never create long blocks of text.\n- DIALOGUE FORMATTING: Put EVERY speaker's line on its own new line. Never combine dialogue from multiple characters in one paragraph.\n- NO MARKDOWN: Do NOT use Markdown formatting anywhere (no ###, **, *, _, or headers).\n- NO ESCAPE CHARACTERS: Do NOT output raw slash escape symbols like \\n or \\t. Produce clean, standard paragraph line breaks.\n- NO TITLES: Do NOT include chapter titles or headings at the top. Begin directly with the story prose.\n- Output Language: Indonesia.\n\nPrimary Writing Style Guidelines:\n{{ $json.story_info[0]['Writing Style'] }}",
          "maxIterations": 10
        }
      },
